<%- include('partials/head', { title: 'Home' }) %>
<%- include('partials/site-header') %>

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Pillars for Sustainable Empowerment</div>
    <h1>Specialized Talent Advisory for Saudi Arabia's Vision 2030 Economy</h1>
    <p class="sub">We connect highly specialized Saudi female professionals with Vision 2030 entities, Giga-Projects, and PIF subsidiaries — closing the Kingdom's qualitative localization gap.</p>
    <a class="btn btn-white" href="/apply">Apply as a Candidate</a>
    <a class="btn btn-outline" href="/#contact">Hire With PSE</a>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- ABOUT -->
<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow-dark">About Us</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">A boutique consulting firm built for one mandate</h2>
    <p style="max-width:700px;font-size:15.5px;color:#26282C;">PSE is a specialized management consulting boutique dedicated to solving the most critical talent challenge facing the Kingdom's economic transformation: the <strong>qualitative localization gap</strong> for highly specialized Saudi female professionals.</p>
    <p style="max-width:700px;font-size:15.5px;color:#26282C;">We partner exclusively with Vision 2030 entities, Giga-Projects, and PIF subsidiaries who demand technical excellence and strategic compliance in their most critical roles.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- VISION & MISSION -->
<section class="alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow-dark">Vision &amp; Mission</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Where we're going, and how we get there</h2>
    <div class="grid-2">
      <div class="vm-card">
        <div class="icon-badge"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'eye' }) %></div>
        <h3>Our Vision</h3>
        <p>To be the indispensable strategic advisory partner in the Kingdom for achieving qualitative national localization — enabling the strategic integration of the top 1% of highly specialized Saudi female professionals into critical national sectors.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="vm-card">
        <div class="icon-badge"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'target' }) %></div>
        <h3>Our Mission</h3>
        <p>To leverage proprietary technical and psychometric assessment frameworks to deliver high-impact consulting solutions that enable Vision 2030 organizations to strategically identify, onboard, and sustainably manage specialized Saudi female talent.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- MARKET IMPERATIVE -->
<section class="dark">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow-dark">The Market Imperative</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">The gap is closing fast — quality hasn't kept pace</h2>
    <div class="stats">
      <div><div class="stat-num" style="color:#fff;">17%</div><div class="stat-label">Female labor force participation, 2017</div></div>
      <div><div class="stat-num" style="color:#fff;">36%</div><div class="stat-label">Female labor force participation, 2025</div></div>
      <div><div class="stat-num" style="color:#fff;">40%</div><div class="stat-label">Revised Vision 2030 target by decade-end</div></div>
    </div>
    <p style="max-width:700px;margin-top:36px;font-size:14.5px;">Quantitative localization is being met. The remaining challenge is qualitative: placing genuinely specialized women — engineers, analysts, project leads — into roles that carry real technical and strategic weight. That is the gap PSE exists to close.</p>
    <p style="font-size:11.5px;color:#5A5E66;font-style:italic;margin-top:16px;">Source: General Authority for Statistics (GASTAT); Vision 2030 KPI tracker, 2025.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SERVICE STANDARD (honest replacement for "PSE in Numbers") -->
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow-dark">Our Service Standard</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">What you can hold us to</h2>
    <div class="stats">
      <div><div class="stat-num" style="color:#0A0A0A;">14</div><div class="stat-label" style="color:#6B6F76;">working days to first qualified shortlist</div></div>
      <div><div class="stat-num" style="color:#0A0A0A;">Top 3</div><div class="stat-label" style="color:#6B6F76;">technically proficient candidates, guaranteed</div></div>
      <div><div class="stat-num" style="color:#0A0A0A;">90</div><div class="stat-label" style="color:#6B6F76;">day replacement guarantee window</div></div>
    </div>
    <p class="form-note" style="margin-top:28px;max-width:700px;">These are operating commitments for every engagement, not historical claims — PSE is a newly registered advisory boutique in the Kingdom of Saudi Arabia. Each mandate is held to this standard from day one.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- SERVICE MODELS -->
<section class="alt" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow-dark">Service Models</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Three ways we engage</h2>
    <div class="grid-3">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-badge"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'briefcase' }) %></div>
        <h3>Strategic Executive Search</h3>
        <p>High-level retained advisory for C-suite and director roles, requiring extreme discretion and access to the rarest female leadership talent.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-badge"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'zap' }) %></div>
        <h3>Contract Staffing Advisory</h3>
        <p>Rapid supply of specialized Saudi female talent for fixed-term projects or immediate operational capacity injection.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card">
        <div class="icon-badge"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'users' }) %></div>
        <h3>Permanent Placement Advisory</h3>
        <p>Sourcing candidates for long-term, direct employment within the client's organizational structure.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- THE PSE DIFFERENTIATOR -->
<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow-dark">The PSE Differentiator</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">Beyond CV filtering</h2>
    <div class="row-list" style="max-width:820px;">
      <div class="num-row">
        <div class="icon-badge"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'search' }) %></div>
        <div class="num-content">
          <h4>Deep Technical Assessment</h4>
          <p>We move beyond CV filtering. Candidates are pre-vetted against industry-specific technical criteria to ensure immediate operational capability from day one.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="num-row">
        <div class="icon-badge"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'trending' }) %></div>
        <div class="num-content">
          <h4>Vision 2030 Alignment Scoring</h4>
          <p>We evaluate candidates' experience in Giga-Projects or their direct contribution to national KPIs, ensuring they meet the qualitative standards of the localization mandate.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="num-row">
        <div class="icon-badge"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'zap' }) %></div>
        <div class="num-content">
          <h4>Speed in Scarcity</h4>
          <p>Our continuous, focused talent pool mapping allows us to generate a viable, vetted shortlist faster than generalist firms who must start from scratch for niche requests.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- STRATEGIC PARTNERSHIP & RISK MITIGATION -->
<section class="alt">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow-dark">Risk Mitigation</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">A partnership structured around your risk</h2>
    <div class="plain-rows">
      <div class="plain-row">
        <div class="icon-badge mono"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'shield' }) %></div>
        <h4>Placement Guarantee</h4>
        <p>We offer a free replacement search if the hired candidate resigns or is terminated for performance reasons within the agreed-upon guarantee period.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="plain-row">
        <div class="icon-badge mono"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'check' }) %></div>
        <h4>Focus on Value</h4>
        <p>We enable compliance with qualitative localization goals, ensuring the client avoids the risk of placing an unqualified individual in a strategic role simply to meet a quota.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="plain-row" style="border-bottom:none;">
        <div class="icon-badge mono"><%- include('partials/icon', { name: 'anchor' }) %></div>
        <h4>Built to Last</h4>
        <p>Our lean operating model is designed for long-term stability, so our commitment to your mandate doesn't depend on deal volume.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

